      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (ví dụ)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111110002.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">１．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><ruby>大阪<rp>(</rp><rt>おおさか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は にぎやかですか。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Osaka có náo nhiệt không?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>&hellip; はい、にぎやかです。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Có, có náo nhiệt.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>さくら<ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>有名<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Đại học Sakura nổi tiếng không?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; いいえ、<ruby>有名<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じゃ ありません。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Không, không nổi tiếng.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">3．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>ペキンは <ruby>今<rp>(</rp><rt>いま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですか。</span><span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Bắc Kinh bây giờ có lạnh không?</span></div></div></div><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; はい、とても <ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いです。</span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Có, rất lạnh.</span></div></div></div><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>シャンハイも <ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですか。</span><span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Thượng Hải cũng lạnh phải không?<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></div></div></div><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">&hellip; いいえ、あまり <ruby>寒<rp>(</rp><rt>さむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くないです。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Không, không lạnh lắm.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">4．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>寮<rp>(</rp><rt>りょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は どうですか</span>。</div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ký túc của đại học như thế nào?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip; <ruby>古<rp>(</rp><rt>ふる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いですが、<ruby>便利<rp>(</rp><rt>べんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Tuy cũ nhưng tiện lợi.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">5．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>きのう <ruby>松本<rp>(</rp><rt>まつもと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんの うちへ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Hôm qua tôi đã đến nhà ông Matsumoto.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" id=\"cke_bm_110S\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span>&hellip;どんな うちですか。<span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" id=\"cke_bm_110E\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Nhà như thế nào vậy?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>きれいな うちです。そして、<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きい うちです。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Nhà đẹp và lớn.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">6．  </span></span><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai8_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>きのう おもしろい<ruby>映画<rp>(</rp><rt>えいが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Hôm qua tôi xem phim thú vị.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>&hellip;なにを <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ましたか。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Đã xem phim gì thế?</span></div></div></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>「七<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>にん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>侍<rp>(</rp><rt>さむらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>」です。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Phim &ldquo;Bảy chàng võ sĩ Samurai&rdquo;.</span></div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
